     "id": "deponent",
     "title": "Deponent",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "para",
       "text": "Summers notes that the word \"deponent\" comes from the Latin root \"deponere\" meaning to \"lay aside.\"  It is used for these verbs because they have \"laid aside\" (dropped) their active verb forms (p. 51)."
      }
